CVE-2026-39356 exp:2026-11-08

# next 14.2.35 -> needs >=15.5.24, 10 GHSAs incl. 2 critical RCEs (SEC-018)
CVE-2026-75604 exp:2026-11-08
GHSA-2xp9-vwfh-vxw4 exp:2026-11-08
CVE-2026-44573 exp:2026-11-08
CVE-2026-44578 exp:2026-11-08
CVE-2026-64641 exp:2026-11-08
CVE-2026-64645 exp:2026-11-08
CVE-2026-64649 exp:2026-11-08
